    <description>
      <Value><![CDATA[This survey aims to explore individuals' lifestyle habits and how they may affect heart health. It focuses on areas such as diet, physical activity, sleep, stress levels, and other daily habits that contribute to maintaining a healthy heart. Your responses will help us better understand heart health awareness and the importance of making healthy lifestyle choices.]]></Value>
